Downloads volumes and chapters from Mangadex and converts them into .epub or
.pdf files.


mangadex-dl [OPTIONS] SUBCOMMAND


OPTIONS:
  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit
          --version           Display program version information and exit
          --json              Write machine-readable JSON to stdout
  -q,     --quiet             Only print errors
  -v,     --verbose [0]       Print more detail to stderr (repeatable)
          --color TEXT:{auto,always,never} [auto]  
                              Colorize output: auto, always or never

SUBCOMMANDS:
  hello                       Print a greeting

Exit status:
  0   success
  1   runtime failure (including a failed write to stdout)
  2   usage error
  70  internal error (a bug: please report it)
